{
  "name": "Sentinel at Death's Door (Grave Domain)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you or a creature you can see within 60 feet of you is reduced to 0 hit points but not killed outright, you can use your Reaction to change its hit points to an amount equal to your Cleric level.</p><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier and you regain all expended uses on a Long Rest.</p>",
